      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1053"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e99f114181c458cf40e2709e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "噢噢～！TP能量充满！！\\n随时可以出动参加训练！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c44984141432aecc95fa31729c7c11e187cc229aab139f23037ce18f933cdacf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1054"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:335e474e283e8330af5849bb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "看卡看！TP攒满了哦☆\\nMarvelous要开始了★ 那么，走起吧☆★☆★",
      "source_fingerprint": "5db45c818af389a04101023a88d7e3ca61b9d902488acd5aaeb3629dcccd562e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1055"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f353485ca3d8792f5a95be47",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "梦、梦中白兴大人对我说『TP已全恢复』……！\\n这是不是意味着训练运也是大吉……！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "abeee096e168a0a0d3a365c6d070da1988b3fa5bed6f6fa207fcff21ca540dc7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1056"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9ced4b1ab6220168fb5aaa1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP好像攒满了。\\n我会先练着的，你随时过来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "328e0805c9432006d4c7e792fef126db5ab417f3b6f56f3995c5f827b3d5e351",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1057"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d65314eed629c2cdfbab785b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP全恢复了～。如果努力训练的话……\\n我也能得到救赎，对吧……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e870f132836fed99d10ca53f0f57237744b1a4f8fc971bfb6a42d54b9ed6ada",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1058"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c3d08139590db23f5bf88073",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "听说TP攒满了。\\n……准备已经做好了，随时可以叫我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "80bb4c6c0cd91e6cc280ff6086fb6f58e0d0bb38684e1f3bc7933ba5de11c75e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1059"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc71956887f60cecedabfb4d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "听说TP全恢复了哦～。托您的福，\\n身体也休息好了……差不多该开始练习了？",
      "source_fingerprint": "20e2c4ab6f48315a37563b752f0e6cdcb88187e53dc0102ffe783ff087fd389f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1060"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9312e198dd9905faae055e75",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP好像全恢复了。之后就看你的了。\\n要如何培育一流的赛马娘，计划定好了吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ac6b541daeb9bed46bd3084d54eff1eb355a8b136d3c31c0713423a1eae333c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1061"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2ce43fb0d22d567085a1efa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练员，TP攒满啦～！\\n为了训练，嘿、嘿、哞！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4703d2a113c39ee217d8fcca4444375259b70f919ec1864f741414f2d7d8dee",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1062"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4829cc90b37bf21e6bced29e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP已经恢复。我已经做好了准备，\\n只要训练员一到就可以开始训练。",
