      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e8c9dc6674d45599a74f8e5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP满了哦TP！\\n涡轮引擎启动！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbacbfd26876070ed3dad5f9b5bb0edaa0b3654f67f3c586faa5129815a18e5e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1066"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a0357c833843bf388868943",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP已经攒满了♪\\n来，让我们开始训练吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d9f31baf35af33cf16407899b00c693a5def7a769cb6f29c6cc9a3fc7d9d162",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1067"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c03e8624b120124a415e4631",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练员，TP攒满了！\\n训练的准备就请交给我吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c95206c555546b922b8aa54425eb9eb57ef0c9f237cc4503a184605b9092929",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1068"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6469332886d6937aabea7a04",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP好像已经攒得满心花开了！\\n能进行好多好多训练，真是期待呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe3af8ae048c3da03321ad6096c71be356f99b6d674a65476ecdb1cc775876db",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1069"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7715da43396946852af7185c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP好像全恢复了。也就是说……\\n训练时间到了。跟我来！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba0ca9a139676d02b34502adc302748f5ff4f36025fe5584a6315690fd786bcd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1070"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1378ef5d4306a18619a74a0b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP已经完全恢复。我会一边认真拉伸，\\n一边在此恭候。",
      "source_fingerprint": "564cd5bea0884e657d10f24112a778c7c2378ae2aaea04be2daa25aaa9900040",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1071"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:037c31bdf1de0db94c5c2f35",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP似乎攒满了！\\n去锻炼吧！这就出发，出发！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "442741995221d7be1125d602dd02757bd60ddb711c48ed43e3d798755857eab9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1072"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:143513c09a36b899dd7442a8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP 满格，元气也满格哦！我等着你——咳咳咳咳……！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "50dacaf1750e4c957afe5c890202fdd7288b0ae727d0fe7e5f4086059e8cacc1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1073"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1dcbec6720319945806e2c9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "哎呀～？TP好像已经完全恢复了呢～。\\n请在您喜欢的时机叫我吧～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5060e04579ba1e9e7c32d7b6a79e74bead6d50c8aa3a4bdddbb353f7948e359",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1074"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c004d8227918f153120bcee",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP好像恢复了！\\n腿部的状态也完美！我等着你哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6593adae5f0e0ba64e95253a50f637d5ea13af33885e26498acd0f50a4c83bd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1076"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce7467a25ba6f7dbae652196",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训练员，TP好像满了！\\n我先走一步开始热身了哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "97379f5ad3d7b48a423ef22737ad598e4d97ea8ed078b4eb33e03f43ad11bc28",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1077"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47f36515a09718575c4c280c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP好像全恢复了。\\n我会在顺风吹拂的地方等你。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9829bf58211eb4c8cf0f081113d13edd0990b026a3c45e8ef09b5a13ad83150",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1078"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:66d87b3a6ffed2e6c65c8b99",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP 已经满了呢。\\n为了船桥的未来，让我们一起不断锻炼吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec123a85ba16ca6416f3f2c0284096463512c90744ce8de19f3bf1d536cb4a86",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1079"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e4c498bdfce7f147ffb023e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "训酱，给你个好消息～。\\nTP满了哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8bf7d92f91a5545e58473d683a913956991459749a6982d5f165c0113d65b739",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1080"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:203818568a4a7a98efb9b8bc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "喂，TP攒满了！\\n我会拼命锻练，让所有人都刮目相看！",
      "source_fingerprint": "67984ec1dcdfece78bdc85e217fe7cef1df180ffaaf30f9e3d7e6b25c22853f4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1081"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:317ba951457a851720a268cc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP已经攒满了。\\n让我们华丽地开跑吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5f2718ce4a83672712d530624ffd10d34b7ff7c71a102d0410fc294ce86db6d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1082"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da18dc6b9e898a6299688fbd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "报告。TP已全恢复。\\n训练准备也已完成。",
      "source_fingerprint": "009265db90abae60d295d197293bb08a8ac160deb8b7f15fc0230c710a582c13",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1083"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c9adbd9af1ce4748897bdbd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "……TP已充盈。若想开始锻炼，\\n随时奉陪。我会为你准备好欢迎的一杯。",
      "source_fingerprint": "485cd01bd15d70d11d1bf580cd3355a18ebb6b4c268af0f5c6c9e59788ae7467",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1084"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d88999b65572a9d132ce167f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP已达上限。这边的准备已经完成，\\n请开始训练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec1149a8fd95a90c7136e2ce5b791600ba327ecd5646ae428b1a2f6850923db3",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1085"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ded3e572b57e9a8233400a9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "听说TP已经满了。\\n该做什么，你应该很清楚吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "848a7ffd4ff816bffd7ba8002eeffe3d55c5fdaab5ffbe92c06902a79ac648e8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1086"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32c88178b00c6fad85884aa1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "＜热搜词：TP全恢复！＞\\n所以可以开始训练了。请多关照。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a84a6c323025ccd946b9e7283a694d0c81a7b7e691869b1bf7a3a884d1d67da",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1087"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c46420f6b7d60bf36c38c9d8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP攒满啦！\\n那么，该从哪一项开始练起呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ff1f86452e5f0549c5607bfd7e0f89210bcab04d5586bc84823d1f2313b11f5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1088"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa45c096c6a8d0040f1bb22d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP好像已经攒满了。\\n可以的话，那个……要训练吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea5b1cbf188dd222eb45c31b340ad1a52f1c9404f5fe62b7bdfc150578506533",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1089"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2b1f4602edf35a71313d5856",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "看起来 TP 已经积攒起来了。\\n为了成为妹妹们的榜样，今天也要加油才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d768ec08aac6d189731e4f5d579f80948ddb2288ed90dc7186c5bd3171b8da2b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1090"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9fc2c7595e14b905547b6de3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP满了哦！\\n我会乖乖等着你的，快点来呀♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "658e36995de6019d1b6a2572958b5b33be6c1e956a5ab30250f471c164b1feb0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1091"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a358dc0095c25dd81f33701d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "啊，TP攒满了呢。\\n我随时都在等着你哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "850c2c22187cf8de1749b693f7b1ed7a803090865aa9031eabe5b3a1b91b0d52",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1092"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a311369075478181d9aff8ac",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP好像已经恢复了。\\n今天也想跑个痛快！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1c89c85b9ce6b43dd26d55df862e1bae48226f511f03c36275170e69858d935",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1093"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c821e5283d3d80687b62edd8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "好嘞，TP攒满了。\\n喂，训练要开始了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c49ec217fffbc84842d63b10255a9dc2fda813deab240ceeb7071610dd2763c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1094"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea94ee18341b120f25a5e09e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP恢复了。\\n那么……我先去准备了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7199b18502345cf3345e4681a1fc64534c3a9938cca55903f2d1563779007de",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1095"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e7cfb06a75a06ce85677ec3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "嗯，TP 积攒够了。时机已到！",
      "source_fingerprint": "64d522f171af9f14f884a1bc00223c1a7789ab907950c0a8f61490cdc91900b5",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1096"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb6d59c08e12ba27f4bf6671",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP攒满了。又可以见到你了呢……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd7948459c38afc6de041e5836fdb8aba1e7bed94b8fdf5ad1eaf8e00edc7b8c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1097"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4724ffa1231fae3243b5528e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP全恢复！阳气也十分充沛，\\n随时可以开始训练哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3181166a0a6d2861a3f62c6c88d5fc820fb234b8b55b8dcf9cb380e5d3f360c4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1098"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa2b670f83245b714e91b27f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP已经恢复了。我会先做热身，\\n请随时过来指导！",
      "source_fingerprint": "28b1674efd57bdf6abfea62dc4a806f86a21ffa5cd49c755a36dc851196d0bcd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1099"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b699f1027cef1d80eb5012e9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP攒满啦。日积月累，\\n努力训练。今天也请多关照喽。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4422ade5aeec0de21688fbd67b36fdd8c7f928c48988bb4a035bead403825b6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90dfb93ef8a8e618fc261629",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "瞧，TP已经满了！\\n拨动轻快的足音，为协奏曲做准备吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4dc6444b4a05a9fae658d6d4de4e2316ee5c5e18698c7901c1f14ce9992d211e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "184",
        "1102"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c25fa03ca5e6e46473c147ac",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "TP攒满喽～☆呼呼咻！\\n——怎么样，这个角色设定如何？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c6814d4605878ffb72e42ad0eee9eeee4bca081e0638c2d37d78ec227143b01",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
